 "about": "SHIP-FIRST rule (Divit 2026-11-12): pages ship on automated checks without waiting for the independent review, EXCEPT legal, medical, health, financial and insurance pages, which still need the review before shipping. A page is YMYL when any pattern matches its slug or primary keyword (case-insensitive, word-boundary). When in doubt a term is listed: a false YMYL only costs a pre-ship review; a missed one ships unreviewed copy on a sensitive topic. Terms in 'stems' match as a word prefix (psycholog -> psychology); every other term matches as a whole word with an optional plural s/es (law never matches lawn).",
